(EXPERT DECISION SYSTEMS ZIMBABWE \(XDS\)) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
(Information Security Policy \(ISSP\) Summary) Tj T*
(8th Floor Pegasus House, Samora Machel, Harare, Zimbabwe | info@xds.co.zw) Tj T*
(------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
() Tj T*
/F2 11 Tf
(1. OVERVIEW) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
(XDS's objective is to be recognised as a trusted custodian of information,) Tj T*
(particularly information supplied by subscribers, in all the markets it) Tj T*
(operates in. This Information Security Policy \(ISSP\) plays an integral part) Tj T*
(in XDS's objective of safeguarding all information in its possession.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
/F2 11 Tf
(2. INFORMATION SECURITY MISSION) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
(XDS pledges that it will maintain a responsible approach to information) Tj T*
(security, in line with best industry practice, complying with relevant) Tj T*
(legislation, regulatory requirements and safeguarding confidentiality,) Tj T*
(integrity and availability of customer and Company assets.) Tj T*
(- Permit collection, use, disclosure and modification only in line with) Tj T*
(  genuine business, legal, regulatory and contractual obligations.) Tj T*
(- Protect the copyright of XDS, customer and other licensed software.) Tj T*
(- Maintain the privacy of all personal and customer information.) Tj T*
(- Establish the bona-fides of persons requesting access to information.) Tj T*
(- Ensure security is commensurate with the value of protected information.) Tj T*
(- Actively monitor access to identify breaches and enforce compliance.) Tj T*
(- Safeguard information and systems against destruction or denial of use.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
/F2 11 Tf
(3. INFORMATION ACCESS PHILOSOPHY) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
(All access to information by staff, customers and other third parties is) Tj T*
(provided on the 'need to know' principle basis, in line with an approved) Tj T*
(business function and necessary to the successful completion of that function.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
/F2 11 Tf
(4. SCOPE OF INFORMATION SECURITY POLICY) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
(The Policy applies to all XDS employees and contractors irrespective of) Tj T*
(geographic location. Any persons requiring access to information must adhere) Tj T*
(to the general principles of this Policy and specific written agreements.) Tj T*
ET
